    "Cue knows you're recording because iOS pauses its audio when another app starts recording. If an app doesn't do this, tap **▶** in the window. While the window is open, your music is paused." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cue nota que grabas porque iOS le pausa el audio cuando otra app empieza a grabar. Si alguna app no lo hace, toca **▶** en la ventana. Mientras la ventana está abierta, tu música se pausa."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cue needs to restart to change the language." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cue necesita reiniciarse para cambiar el idioma."
